  <h1 class="article-title">Policy</h1>
  <div class="article-content">
    <h2>Privacy</h2>
    <p>FZH Studio is designed as a lightweight, static website. This starter does not include advertising trackers, analytics, comment services, or third-party embeds.</p>
    <h2>Search</h2>
    <p>Search runs in the visitor's browser using the locally hosted Pagefind index. Search queries are not sent to a third-party search service.</p>
    <h2>External links</h2>
    <p>Links to other websites are governed by their own privacy policies and terms.</p>
    <p class="small-note">Review and update this policy to reflect the services you actually use before publishing.</p>
